      "side": 1,
      "message": "Given that roles are optional, I\u0027d expect a project to be optional -- there\u0027s not really any meaning to having one without the other. This also seems useful if you enable impersonation without scoping -- useful for requesting another user\u0027s list of projects/domains in keystone, for example.",
