      "writtenOn": "2013-02-27T14:44:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Good point.  As I thought it over, I realized that the objects creates are all using UUIDs that had to be server side generated, and so delaying the validation is pointless.\n\nI\u0027d like to note, tho0ugh, that I still don\u0027t want to delete trusts after creation just because a user has lost a role.  Those changes and assignments may be temporary, and should not cause trusts to go away.",
      "parentUuid": "AAAAM3/+jsY\u003d",
      "revId": "3b0799ee1bad697def17fa9fb21dca130abcc143",
      "serverId": "4a232e18-c5a9-48ee-94c0-e04e7cca6543",
